[1m[38;5;231mHow should `export` determine the output format and destination?[0m

[38;5;153m❯[39m [38;5;246m1.[39m [38;5;153mExplicit --format + --out (Recommended)[39m
     [38;5;246mBoth required: reportkit export --day D --format csv --out PATH. Unambiguous in cron lines.[39m
  [38;5;246m2.[39m Infer format from --out extension
     [38;5;246m.csv/.json picks the writer; --format overrides. Terser, but silent on odd extensions.[39m
  [38;5;246m3.[39m --format required, --out optional
     [38;5;246mDefaults to stdout when --out is omitted, so output can be piped as well as written.[39m
